# Public, non-secret settings for production builds (Vercel included).
# Committed on purpose: Next.js loads this file during `next build`, so
# these don't need to be entered in the Vercel dashboard. A variable set
# in Vercel's dashboard still takes precedence over this file.
#
# NEVER put secrets here (DATABASE_URL, ADMIN_PASSWORD): they belong in
# Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.

# Shown in the site footer.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL="sonotechnologies@gmail.com"

# Canonical / Open Graph / sitemap URL. Left unset on purpose: the app
# falls back to Vercel's production domain (VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL).
# Set it here when a custom domain is added, e.g. "https://subproof.com".
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=""
